  "title": "A self-maintaining system can be read as inferring",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "d8fff78f-b6f2-4793-8a29-3478da187e09",
      "text": "A system that keeps itself within a bounded set of states can be described as if its internal states infer the causes of its sensory states. The description does not say the system computes anything explicitly.",
